# Allowlist: the build context only receives what the images need, so env files, private
# notes, indexes and model weights cannot reach an image by accident.
*
!global.json
!SupportAssistant.slnx
!src/

# Local environments and build outputs inside the allowed folders.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.env
**/.env.*
